### Test Mock Data Endpoints

### Check database status (no auth required for testing)
GET http://localhost:5295/api/admin/database-status

### Register site admin to get token for testing
POST http://localhost:5295/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testadmin",
  "email": "testadmin@test.com",
  "password": "TestPass123!",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Admin"
}

### Login as site admin
POST http://localhost:5295/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "siteadmin@petwhenua.co.nz",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}

### Seed mock data (requires site admin token)
POST http://localhost:5295/api/admin/seed-mock-data?forceRecreate=false
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

### Get mock data summary
GET http://localhost:5295/api/admin/mock-data-summary
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Force recreate mock data
POST http://localhost:5295/api/admin/seed-mock-data?forceRecreate=true
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

### Clear mock data
DELETE http://localhost:5295/api/admin/clear-mock-data
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE 